855eb4e M46 v6.6 CRITICAL BUGFIX (user report): after opening TROPHIES and returning to the main menu, the Rafzzer button did nothing. Root cause: showOverlay('start') re-injects #tplStart on every return, and the boot-time DIRECT addEventListener on #btnMenuAI was attached to a node that gets destroyed — the re-injected button had no handler (the game already delegates #btnTrophies/#btnStart for exactly this reason). Fix: the AI binds moved to a document-level click handler (#btnMenuAI = watch mode, #btnAI = in-game toggle) — delegation survives every re-injection; the corner button lives in the static HUD. Regression test test/menu_trophy_ai.mjs added to npm test: fails on the bug (reproduces: node destroyed + click does nothing), now ALL PASS (fresh-menu click arms AI; TROPHIES->BACK->click arms AI; corner toggle works; no page errors). smoke.mjs + menu.test.mjs green. MASTER §7d + AGENT_BRIEF updated in this commit.
